      <div class="regime-row">
        <span class="name">🇮🇷 Iran (Regime Collapse)</span>
        <span class="p">15–20%</span>
        <div class="drivers">Mass protests have continued in Tehran, Isfahan, and Tabriz since July; IRGC internal communications leaked to Iran International in October cited "loyalty fracture" concerns at mid-level command. Mojtaba's sustained absence and Khamenei's wartime isolation remove the public face needed to consolidate a post-war succession narrative. Economic deterioration at rial 950,000/dollar and fuel rationing compound civilian grievance on a trajectory not documented since 2019. Reviewed weekly; last updated 2026-10-04.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="regime-row">
        <span class="name">🇮🇱 Israel (Netanyahu Steps Down)</span>
        <span class="p">5–10%</span>
        <div class="drivers">Likud now polling below Yashar in four of five major surveys, with Netanyahu privately acknowledging the seat loss. A post-election coalition failure, combined with renewed judicial oversight proceedings and a potential accountability commission into October 7, 2023 failures, raises the step-down probability above its pre-war base rate. Caretaker PM status limits Netanyahu's ability to control coalition formation outcomes. Reviewed weekly; last updated 2026-10-04.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

